m920194.勝者には褒美がなければならぬ！\n狩りならば最も良い肉を、\n戦場ならば勝利と領:
A victor must receive a reward!
In the hunt, the finest meat;
on the battlefield, victory and territory!

m920194.土と砂は別物ですから……。\nそれにこれは、砂嵐を発生させているのではなく、\n:
Earth and sand are different things…….
Besides, this isn't generating a sandstorm;
it is summoning one with the power of an Elemental.
